		(uuid "77d89b56-4f9d-4905-9874-e99945712344")
	)
	(text_box "Precharge DCDC_AIR 90% check:\n\nV_ACCU and V_DCDC are equally scaled HV measurements.\n\nV_ACC_90 = V_ACCU * R_LOW / (R_HIGH + R_LOW)\n\nR_HIGH = 1.00M\nR_LOW  = 9.09M\n\nV_ACC_90 ≈ 0.900 * V_ACCU\n\nPRCHG_DCDC_AIR_DONE:\nIN+ = V_DCDC\nIN- = V_ACC_90\nHIGH when V_DCDC >= 0.9 * V_ACCU\nUsed as MCU status input.\n\nAIR_P interlock:\nSame comparator condition is also used as open-drain clamp without pullup at AIR_P driver.\nComparator can only block AIR_P, not enable it.\n\nFirmware should close AIR_P only after V_DCDC >= 95% * V_ACCU with debounce.\nHardware lockout threshold: 90%"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
